<title>CHINA: Trading in Kumagai Gumi shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Kumagai Gumi shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended in early morning at company request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the construction company gained HK$0.40 or 4.6 percent to HK$9.10 prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 170,000 shares worth HK$1.52 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6730</p>
</text>
